<header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MONEY</p><h1>お金</h1><p>金額はBudgetItem、支払い状況は入出金履歴から表示します。</p></div><%= link_to "金額を追加", new_budget_item_path, class: "button primary" %></header>
<div class="metrics"><div><span>総支出</span><strong><%= number_to_currency(@expense_total || 0, unit: "", precision: 0) %><small>円</small></strong></div><div><span>総収入</span><strong><%= number_to_currency(@income_total || 0, unit: "", precision: 0) %><small>円</small></strong></div><div><span>負担見込み</span><strong><%= number_to_currency(@burden_estimate, unit: "", precision: 0) %><small>円</small></strong><small>金額未確認<%= @unknown_count %>件を除く</small></div></div>
<%= form_with url: budget_items_path, method: :get, class: "task-filters surface" do |f| %><div class="field"><%= f.label :direction, "収支" %><%= f.select :direction, [["すべて", ""]] + BudgetItem::DIRECTIONS.map { |k,v| [v,k] }, selected: @direction %></div><%= f.submit "絞り込む", class: "button secondary" %><% end %>
<p class="muted task-result-count"><%= @total_count %>件 · 概算を含む現時点の集計</p><section class="surface list-surface"><% if @budget_items.empty? %><div class="empty-state"><h2>金額はまだありません</h2><p>手動で項目名・金額・概算／確定を入力できます。</p><%= link_to "金額を追加", new_budget_item_path, class: "button primary" %></div><% end %><% @budget_items.each do |item| %><article class="task-row"><div class="row-content"><h3><%= item.title %></h3><div class="micro"><%= BudgetItem::DIRECTIONS[item.direction] %> · <%= BudgetItem::CERTAINTIES[item.certainty] %> · <%= item.amount_yen.nil? ? "金額未確認" : number_to_currency(item.amount_yen, unit: "", precision: 0) + "円" %> · <%= item.payment_status %><% if item.remaining_amount %> · <%= item.certainty == "confirmed" ? "未払い" : "支払い見込み残り" %> <%= number_to_currency(item.remaining_amount, unit: "", precision: 0) %>円<% end %></div></div><div class="task-actions"><%= link_to "編集", edit_budget_item_path(item), class: "button secondary" %><%= link_to "履歴を追加", new_budget_item_money_movement_path(item), class: "button secondary" %></div></article><% end %></section><%= render "shared/pagination", total: @total_count, page: @page %>
